WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Surprise Forward approaches the knocked-down Ryu.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.500
Back medium kick catches the recorded wakeup action as Counter Hit.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.000
The crouching jab links after the back-medium counter hit.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Light Electric Thunder finishes the jab conversion.

5
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.100
Ryu falls after the counter-hit conversion.
